Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.16,0:00:02.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,He was known by many titles.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.56,0:00:05.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,Some knew what he built.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.36,0:00:07.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,Others only knew what he kept.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.85,0:00:10.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keld did not offer to\Nthink in their place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.63,0:00:14.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,He listened, cleared a space on\Nthe workbench, and began making
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.87,0:00:16.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,what they needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.59,0:00:18.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,An instrument to carry a memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.97,0:00:21.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,A mechanism to test a possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.59,0:00:23.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,A connection where there had been none.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.43,0:00:26.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,“Even minds need tools.”
